### ============================================
### ELASTICSEARCH / SEARCH DEBUG
### ============================================
### Используйте `elastic_host` для прямых запросов к контейнеру shop_elasticsearch.
### Вариант для docker-сети: http://shop_elasticsearch:9200
### Вариант для локального проброса порта: http://localhost:9200
### ============================================

### Проверка доступности кластера Elasticsearch
GET {{elastic_host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Статус кластера
GET {{elastic_host}}/_cluster/health
Accept: application/json

### Список индексов
GET {{elastic_host}}/_cat/indices/products?v
Accept: text/plain

### Поиск: plastic в title/description
POST {{elastic_host}}/products/_search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "multi_match": {
            "query": "plastic",
            "fields": ["title^2", "description"]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "from": 0,
  "size": 10,
  "_source": ["id", "title", "slug", "price", "available", "category_id"]
}

### Поиск: plastic + category_id =1 ( по факту он должен быть category_id=4)
POST {{elastic_host}}/products/_search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "multi_match": {
            "query": "plastic",
            "fields": ["title^2", "description"]
          }
        }
      ],
      "filter": [
        {
          "term": {
            "category_id": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "from": 0,
  "size": 10,
  "_source": ["id", "title", "slug", "price", "available", "category_id"]
}

### Поиск: plastic + price range[1-100] + availability(есть в наличии)
POST {{elastic_host}}/products/_search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "multi_match": {
            "query": "plastic",
            "fields": ["title^2", "description"]
          }
        }
      ],
      "filter": [
        {
          "range": {
            "price": {
              "gte": 1,
              "lte": 1000
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "range": {
            "available": {
              "gt": 0
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "from": 0,
  "size": 10,
  "_source": ["id", "title", "slug", "price", "available", "category_id"]
}

### Проверка роутa приложения /search
GET {{host}}/search?q=plastic&page=1&limit=10&sort_by=added&sort_order=desc
Accept: text/html

